define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/destruct_b> {
    it also assigns the action</maker>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is being destroyed.
    } and it does {
        define the position<held_result>.
        move the particle in action</maker>::position<result> to position<held_result>.
        move the particle in position<held_result> to action</maker>::position<result>.
